# Conversation

- `/model` — choose a model
- `/sessions` or `/resume` — choose a session
- `/fork` — branch from a user message
- `/cd <path>` — change workspace
- `/compact` — summarize active context
- `/transcript` — inspect original messages, tools, and reasoning summaries
- `/extensions` — list extension commands
- `/status` — show session identity

# Input and appearance

- Ctrl+S — stash or append the saved draft
- Ctrl+V or `/image <path>` — attach an image
- Ctrl+O or `/copy` — copy the last response
- Ctrl+T — open the transcript
- Ctrl+L — clear the visible screen
- `/theme` — choose a syntax theme
- Enter — send or steer; Tab — queue a follow-up
- Ctrl+C — interrupt; `/quit` — exit
